    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Lustful Hours is a cinematic adult visual novel following Max White\u2014a newly funded startup founder\u2014through one intense, erotic, and emotionally volatile day that will change his life forever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831630/extras/ff242edf232cec6d2685ec58f8f0635d.avif?t=1755625725\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> <br>After months of grinding work, Max finally gets the investment that puts his real estate software on the map. A vacation with his wife Jenny to a private island resort is supposed to be a celebration, a chance to reconnect. But when an ill-timed business call interrupts their first intimate moment, the tension between them explodes\u2014and Max storms off alone, unknowingly setting off a chain of encounters, revelations, and temptations he never saw coming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831630/extras/cedd7e9b30b771e640b4763745d3573a.avif?t=1755625725\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br> <br>Across sunlit beaches, quiet caf\u00e9s, hidden rooftops, spas, gyms, bars, and dark alleys, Max meets a cast of unforgettable women. Some challenge him. Some comfort him. Some simply offer heat, danger, or pleasure. As the day unfolds, Max is drawn deeper into a web of lust, loyalty, corruption, and emotional reckoning with consequences far bigger than his marriage.<br><br><br>Features<br> \u2013 Over 2,500 ultra-detailed renders in native 4K <br>\u2013 Nearly 100 animated sex scenes, each fully voiced by action and expression <br>\u2013 25,000+ words of character-driven story and erotic buildup <br>\u2013 Full-length soundtrack, scene gallery, and post-game epilogues for every major character</p>",
